# UMLS-derived validation corpus. CHV ships only inside the gated UMLS Metathesaurus
# release, so it may be USED here by a licence holder but never redistributed - which
# committing it would do. bin/fetch_chv rebuilds it; corpus/README.md explains how.
/corpus/*
!/corpus/README.md
